		{
			dependencies: ["6A560CEA986B82C2"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#7BC96F to=#C8ECBF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>Verdant 字体</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>自然祭坛，还有在旁边站三分钟的那部分，</grad><grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>你站在那儿三分钟，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>对吧？</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7BC96F to=#C8ECBF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>底部为 </grad><grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>Infused Brick</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，三乘三。其中四块是控制器及其端口。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部和角落是 </grad><grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>黄金石砖</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，边缘是 </grad><grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>远古木板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而中间是一个真正的 </grad><grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>自然祭坛</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 建造此结构需要一个可用的祭坛。黄金石砖也会从祭坛上掉落，所以别无他法。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#7BC96F to=#C8ECBF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>催化剂</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"将 <grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>Transmutation Catalyst</grad> 或 <grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>Crumbling Catalyst</grad> 放入物品端口并留在那里。它 <grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>不会被消耗</grad>。它只会决定 Font 运行哪些配方。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两者可同时放置。只有一个输入被两者共用：灵魂土用其中一个会产出恶魂之泪，用另一个会产出灵魂沙，所以想要哪个产物就加载对应的催化剂。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#7BC96F to=#C8ECBF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>喂食</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将物品放入 </grad><grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>物品端口</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每边六个槽位</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad><grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>每次合成消耗 5000 FE</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>光环未通过管道输入。而是通过</grad><grad from=#8FE07A to=#3F9E2C f=0.8>时间支付</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>祭坛每刻只能从世界中抽取三百点灵气，因此熔炉以该速率运行所有配方。金粉为一秒。浸透岩石为两秒。书中耗时最长的转换超过三分钟。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 你的区块中没有任何东西会消耗气场。代价是时钟。"
				""
				"[!note] 在 JEI 中查找控制器以获取完整列表。"
			]
			icon: "linggango_tweaks:verdant_font"
			id: "32F74AAA1E82CDD1"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "47EF873565B9646B"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			shape: "octagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "光环，启动！嗡嗡嗡嗡"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "3DBF4FE298CD1628"
					item: "linggango_tweaks:verdant_font"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "67A84FFB0F25E2AE"
					item: "linggango_tweaks:verdant_font_item_input"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Verdant 字体"
			x: -0.5d
			y: -20.0d
		}
	]
	title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#e6d520 to=#C0AF27>自然的气息</grad></shadow>"
